{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2023-01-06 08:00:00', 'title': 'ABBVIE AND IMMUNOME ANNOUNCE STRATEGIC COLLABORATION TO DISCOVER MULTIPLE NOVEL ONCOLOGY TARGETS', 'text': "NORTH CHICAGO, ILL. & EXTON, PA.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ABBVIE (NYSE: ABBV) AND IMMUNOME, INC. (NASDAQ: IMNM), A CLINICAL-STAGE BIOPHARMACEUTICAL COMPANY THAT UTILIZES ITS HUMAN MEMORY B CELL PLATFORM TO DISCOVER AND DEVELOP FIRST-IN-CLASS ANTIBODY THERAPEUTICS, TODAY ANNOUNCED A WORLDWIDE COLLABORATION AND OPTION AGREEMENT DIRECTED TO THE DISCOVERY OF UP TO 10 NOVEL ANTIBODY-TARGET PAIRS ARISING FROM THREE SPECIFIED TUMOR TYPES USING IMMUNOME'S DISCOVERY ENGINE."}